{
  "slug": "claude-pulse",
  "name": "Claude Pulse",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "claude-pulse adds a live usage status bar to Claude Code showing your session usage, weekly limits, reset timer, and plan tier — pulled directly from Anthropic's OAuth API. Features 10 colour themes (including animated rainbow with white shimmer), configurable bar sizes, 7 bar styles, 4 text layouts, extra credits tracking, and automatic update notifications. Configure everything with the /pulse interactive wizard — pick themes, colours, and animations without touching config files. Single ...",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands**, `pulse`, `setup`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-pulse@claude-community` from `NoobyGains/claude-pulse`.\n\nReal-time usage monitor for Claude Code — session limits, weekly limits, per-model caps (Opus/Sonnet/Fable), cost tracking, and 10 themes with animations. All in your status bar.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
